---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this personal weblog.">
  <article class="prose page-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Hi, I'm Sam!</h1>
    <p>
      This is a personal weblog about digital minimalism, self hosting, hobbies, experiments,
      and anything else that interests me/
    </p>
    <p>
      It is intentionally a quiet website: no advertising, engagement counters,
      or algorithmic recommendations. I use self-hosted, privacy-friendly analytics for
      aggregate page views and referrals, without advertising profiles or cookies. I want it to feel like the internet of old, where
      people had personal sites and all 'content' wasn't locked in walled gardens beholden to some algorithm.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
